<br>Language skills in English mandatory.
<br>
<br>Professional skills:
<br>Excellent knowledge of Business Process Modeling, Business Process Reengineering and the related Management (BPM) Tools;
<br>SharePoint: Knowledge in using SharePoint for mapping business requirements and managing document workflows;
